message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Physics-Informed Neural Networks (PINNs)"
abstract: "Physics-informed neural networks for the 1D heat equation and the 1D viscous Burgers equation. The heat-equation model is validated against the exact separation-of-variables solution; the Burgers model is validated against a Chebyshev spectral reference solution (Raissi, Perdikaris & Karniadakis, 2019)."
